      "command": "ATD registers a Fabric CLIENT command: advancementssearch highlight <Identifier> [obtained_status].",
      "installedContract": "FabricLoader ID advancements_search; no command registration in installed Search 1.3; AdvancementsScreen has public advancements_search$stopFlashing() and private Identifier flashingAdvancementId. Native startFlashing centers and flashes the matching widget.",
